# Uldaros Theorix: a copy can only be cast if it can be cast (CR 601.2c), and an Aura spell needs something to enchant. Bot1
# exiles Animate Dead (an Aura: "enchant creature card in a graveyard") and the Black Lotus, but no graveyard holds a
# creature card, so the Animate Dead copy has no target and is not offered: only the Lotus is, and after it no question is
# asked (the refusal). The neighbouring scenario, with a creature card in the graveyard, is the positive control.

